d 22/12/2023 the old twins who own the property wrote to claim compensation of D1,695,000.00 stating the land was preserved for their sons.', 'Y', '2023-01-27', 'Y', 'Call', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-23 15:03:38.0914330 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL080', 'M', '2022-12-22', 'Baboucarr Corr', 'Letter', 'Samba Camara C/O Jeggi Conteh', '3074618', 'Samba Conteh C/O Jeggi Conteh, Samba wrote to GRC stating he diagreed with his proposed compensation and was asking for D850,000.00 for his land in a letter dated 14/12/2023', 'Y', '2023-01-27', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-23 16:02:33.2570350 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL081', 'M', '2022-12-29', 'Baboucarr Corr', 'Letter', 'Ebou Touray C/O Neneh S. Secka', '2448458', 'Ebou Touray C/O Neneh S. Secka, Ebou was disclosed a compensation of 24,000.00 for a 5mX50m stripe of land. In a letter to the GRC Ebou through is lawyer demanded a compensation of D321,500.00', 'Y', '2023-01-27', 'Y', 'Call', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-24 20:28:42.3111230 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL082', 'M', '2022-12-27', 'Baboucarr Corr', 'Letter', 'Muhammed Bangura C/O Isatou Dibane', '7612550', 'Muhammed Bangura C/O Isatou Dibane will be impacted 25mX25m plot of land in Brikama. In a conversation with Mr. Bangura he accepted to be compensated land for land and his construction material be transport to his allocated plot.', 'Y', '2023-01-27', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Open.', '2025-04-24 20:36:51.4870370 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL083', 'M', '2023-01-15', 'Baboucarr Corr', 'Letter', 'Ousainou Samateh', '7802217', 'Ousainou wrote to the GRC 20/01/2023 demanding a compensation of D950,000.00', 'Y', '2023-01-26', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-24 20:44:44.4658760 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL084', 'M', '2023-01-15', 'Baboucarr Corr', 'Letter', 'Ousainou Samateh', '7802217', 'Assan Samateh was proposed a compensation D299,249.00 for a 25mX25m plot of land impacted, in a letter dated 20/01/2021 Assan is claiming a compensation of D950,000.00 for cashew and land', 'Y', '2023-01-27', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-24 20:48:37.4649940 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL085', 'M', '2023-01-15', 'Baboucarr Corr', 'Letter', 'Mbemba Ceesay C/O Fabala Barrow', '7983360', 'Mbemba Ceesay C/O Fabala Barrow was proposed a compensation of DD280,000.00 In a latter dated 23/01/2023 Fabala is demanding a compensation of D450,000.00 for his two plots of 20m X 20m.', 'Y', '2023-01-26', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-24 20:52:26.5186330 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D');